{"key": "battle/talk/TalkToneUnknown.mbm#103", "es": "{F871}{0100}Necio...{F801}{F802}{FFFF}"}
{"key": "battle/talk/TalkToneUnknown.mbm#104", "es": "{F871}{0100}Eres valiente. Eso me gusta.{F801}Te escucharé.{F801}{F802}{FFFF}"}
